 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2342  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:52Z (RFD66606-2342) 'Every client logs frame times. At most 1 frame in 100,000 may exceed
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2342  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:53Z (RFD66606-2342) 'twice its budget (27.8 ms at 72 Hz), with zero crashes and zero
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2342  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:54Z (RFD66606-2342) 'disconnects across the playtest. It is measured on OXRSys and on the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2342  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:55Z (RFD66606-2342) 'flat client. Control: a planted 30 ms stall every 10,000 frames must
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2342  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:56Z (RFD66606-2342) 'fail by count.
 # tags: rfd:details
